h their actual molecular/outcome traits, registered primary prior and sensitivity range; do not select only the largest H4 or count signal pairs as independent loci. Report observed pre-restriction coverage versus candidate matching and convergence/fallback. Source-declared complete regions are not independently certified, and H4 is not association FDR or causal direction. If any colocalization result has evidence_grade exploratory_partial_region_major_limitation, reproduce its required_manuscript_caveat in the main-text limitations: the posterior is conditional on observed selected variants, incomplete coverage can bias it, and a null result is not evidence against sharing. Cite retrieved cataloged references where appropriate, retain major contradictory findings in the main text, and keep additional detail in the supplement. Never invent results, novelty, causality or drug efficacy to fill the outline. Structural validation is not scientific validation; untagged older prose needs explicit review, not silent rewriting.";
